  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia West Java Earthquake Emergency Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDEP is currently coordinating and networking with our local partners to identify the most urgent needs of the affected communities. During the emergency relief, IDEP will support the affected communities by providing basic needs (food, clothing, shelter materials, basic medicine, etc.), especially during the first 30 days after the disaster. For recovery and rehabilitation (medium to long-term) phase, IDEP will work with schools and local communities in preparedness and earthquake-safe building</narrative>
  </description>
